390900", "personaname": "Mossgra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976390900/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 27698, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 30, "playtime_at_review": 15317, "last_played": 1788892735, "avatar": "eea8b05786b9f3b05fe10dcd82b6028754a628f3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Life long 40k fan, played at launch, enjoyed it but somehow felt like it wasn't clicking the way I wanted it to. Weapons felt off (bolters generally feeling useless) and the importance of parry's meant I didn't stay as long as I wanted. \nA FEW YEARS LATER, decided to try again. Most of my previous frustrations have been worked on, with most weapons feeling good now and some tweaks to weapon defense styles (melee reactions) making the combat system click finally I'm happily sinking hours into leveling characters and weapons. Upcoming Practice arena will be a huge help with combat onboarding, finally figure out how Bone Sword Warriors work.\nI'll always be a DarkTide lifer (just want more to do) but this is great space for a 40k nerd to hang out", "timestamp_created": 1778886875, "timestamp_updated": 1778886875, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225612854", "author": {"steamid": "76561198267547526", "personaname": "FlyingFinn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198267547526/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1267, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 919, "last_played": 1786037846, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "WH40k at its absolute finest.", "timestamp_created": 17788